      "message": "Not a stupid question. (any are welcome! ^_^)\n\nIt is specific to classpaths_pb2 as it has the generated code to parse/serialize that specific proto message.\n\nprotoc ( - proto compiler) knows how to do this generically for any proto, but only in textproto format. There is an open issue to support JSON as well, https://github.com/protocolbuffers/protobuf/issues/4024.\n\nThese are not the only ones, there are a couple more I\u0027ve seen that do the same for other protos in aosp; sometimes a bit more in case there is a need for some custom checking before/after processing.",
